AEDFA7C"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "324216532323850", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75222940_324216535657183_2732993496674239197_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0ZHEgSfzB9YQ7kNvwErHZlZ&_nc_oc=AdqLeM477pu_yrjv-A7C4x_1-YKPgRWsouYmcIXAp1UXQvb3_lhVy2GdpeNsoeYez-4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTjEpU2zrqzDGPjGzRSaH1jBgaxPYxWYnhqLAZWRTYFvg&oe=6AEE0B9A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "858182618298912", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974844_858182621632245_4461917798521767358_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=343z5VkkFlYQ7kNvwEGa6yq&_nc_oc=AdqeoKuShcrduD1TVwVAZIxAUa76IPB-2ASY8mE-UuzEBne-x4cojOZQW-1i46UYgoU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT3tzsNdfhbGU4GfgezpYx4_7sTG3cg2C6oB9am-GO0kg&oe=6AEDEEAA"}, "display_name": "VeeR: Premium Immersive Entertainment", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Looking for the best latest VR movies\uff1fVeeR have them all.\n\nWhat is special about VeeR:\n\n\u2022 PREMIUM TITLES: VR movies from award-winning studios and latest film festival line-ups\n\n\u2022 FRESH EXPERIENCES CURATED WEEKLY: We've got interactive movies, animations, Sci-Fi, travel & documentaries and so much more\n\n\u2022 HEAD-TRACKED SUBTITLES: Enjoy titles all around the world with English captions\n\n\u2022 ONLINE STREAMING & OFFLINE WATCHING up to 4K \n\n\u2022 VEER VR MOBILE APP:  With the mobile companion app, available on iOS & Android, you can preview and  bookmark titles during your commute or break time and watch later in a VR headset.\n\nDownload VeeR now and start watching!\n\nIf you like VeeR, please rate us and leave a review.\n\n*Any feedback or problems? \nReply within 48 hours: support@veer.tv \n\n*Follow us and stay tuned for new titles:\nFacebook: @letsveer \nTwitter: @letsveer", "short_description": "VeeR is a premium VR entertainment plat